    "description": "Aravind Eye Hospital invites applications from qualified candidates for the position of Radiologist at our Gurgaon location. This role offers excellent career advancement prospects.\n\nAbout Aravind Eye Hospital:\nAravind Eye Hospital is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Administer medications and treatments as prescribed\n• Adhere to NABH/JCI accreditation standards\n• Diagnose and treat medical conditions following established protocols\n• Attend continuing medical education programs and training\n• Collaborate with pharmaceutical representatives and medical suppliers\n• Participate in quality improvement initiatives and clinical audits\n• Educate patients and families on health management and disease prevention\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• BPharm / MPharm / PharmD\n• 3-6 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Wound Care\n• Proficiency in Telemedicine\n• Proficiency in HIPAA Compliance\n• Proficiency in Medical Terminology\n• Proficiency in NABH Standards\n• Proficiency in Medical Ethics\n• Proficiency in ICU Management\n• Proficiency in BLS/ACLS\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Salary Range: 7 LPA - 15 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Gurgaon, Haryana, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Aravind Eye Hospital!",
